        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### AQUA COMMAND · F6 / F7 / F8 Diagnostics\nRUNTIME · UTC · Read only · Configure endpoints, trust certificates, control monitoring and edit notifications in **native F6**. Use **native F7** for authorized refresh/probes. Grafana provides no industrial or notification control."
